  "description": "While grading assignments, Heo Do-ahn comes across a piece of fiction written by Kang Soowon - one that was never meant to be seen by anyone. In it are tales about an intimate encounter with the department’s favorite, Yoo Sung-on. Do-ahn knows he must look away, but is drawn in deeper and deeper as the lines between fantasy and reality appear to blur… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
